					<span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 dark:bg-emerald-400"></span> The Lucky Start (Booming Markets)</span>
					<span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-navy-900 dark:bg-navy-100"></span> The Expected Journey</span>
